<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">LOME</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ola baal a Lome</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lome</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃kaan a Pool ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lome</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔnkaan wu, wu éswɛn Pool ol'akiool ba Lɔm. Ndɛ oli y'ɔbvɛn me ndɔɔ ãtee y'ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel onse Ebvɔon tsɔɔn. Ke mbee epfu y'osiool o Masiã, abeyɛɛn ndiri onse Ayuda b'ayii akiool, eli y'Akilas ye Pilisika(<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Ɛ̃sa 18.2</ref> </char>). Aketal Nsia yi Ngesɛ onse bviil li Lom. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Bvɔɔn li ɛ̃kwel al'eyii onse Lom, me lio lɛn Pool abetee ke Sili ke nsie yi Azi bvool ke nsie yi Ngelek. Nziã atam Pool k'ayi tiil ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ akedzii k'ayi Lom bvool ayi Esipaŋye. Ndɛ bu akel akiool ba Lom ɔ̃nkaan me ndɔɔ yi asuo bɔ ɔ̃wɔɔl a ndɛ(<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:7">1.7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Onse ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ, ndɛ asuo kwɛn Nsia yi Ngesɛ eli waan e Nziã me ndɔɔ obvuul o mbuul wueel wu akiool, Ayuda ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, ke mbee (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:16">1.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool hɛ̃ ali y'ɔ̃wɔɔl wu abvool ɔ̃ta m'owuaal b'akiool b'ali ke Yelusalem. Ŋ'eman Pool k'abvool ɔ̃nta wu eluɔ bvi aketa me ndɔɔ a akiool ba Yeluselɛm, ndɛ bu ayɛn Yude (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:11">Ɛ̃sa 20.11</ref></char>). Ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'ákel ndɛ me lio li odzuu b'édzuu ndɛ b'ãtyel, me nswii tyel yi ési ndɛ ke bviil li Kolinte (mpɛɛ̃-ã-mpɛɛ̃ amvel ba 56 ye 58). Ɔ̃kaal wɛn nkuun Fobe, wu akesal onse Ebvɔɔn li Sankele li eli tsoo-tsoo ye Kolinte ole kal mbuul wu ábiri ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ ke Lɔm (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 16:1">16.1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool lɔɔ-okal kɛn akal y'akiool ba Lom wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ áyɛɛ bɔ kwɛ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:20-24">15.20-24</ref> </char>). Kɛn a ndɛ oyɛɛ akiool bibi b'ali okɔ, b'émwɛɛn a ndɛ k'ãmboo ãkyam bvool b'ebio ndɛ ke swɔɔ li <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'èyi ndɛ bɔ otal onge b'éwɛɛ ndɛ, ndɛ oyuɔɔl bɔ ɔ̃kaan wu asuo ngesɛ-ngesɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãtal obvuul b'onse Mãsia, kwɛn Ebvɔɔn olɔ etuu nzuru ye mpɛn onse okiool, kwɛn hɛ̃ onse Ebvɔɔn olɔ ãtee mã bibi mã baal b'atee onkɔɔ b'Ayuda ãbee mboo obɔɔ. Baal obɔ ali ataal a ntam Pool. Ɔ̃nkaan wu éyuɔɔl ndɛ áli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yɛn Ebvɔɔn ekwel onse bvoo wu Ɔ̃fel bvool ekoo k'ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ onse ãbuɛɛn ã bɔ. Tsoo li ekieel ebwel ndɛ ola bɔ, ndɛ kɛn akal ãtsoo ke kwɛ ye bɔ ye k'èyi ndɛ Nsia yi Ngesɛ otsal k’Esipanye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ke sɔɔ li ɛ̃kwel Pool olieel kal-a-kal ndiri: «Nsia yi Ngesɛ eli waan e Nziã lɛn me lɔ, ndɛ abvuul mbuul wueel wu akiool» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref> </char>). Ke mbee oŋɔ̃ Pool oyɛɛl ndɔɔ oyɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool obɛɛn m'osuo ndiri obi otal baal bueel. Baal bueel bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ k'abɔɔ ɔ̃dzoo bam wɛ ke nkwel a Nziã ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-32">1.18-32</ref></char>), y'Ayuda hɛ̃ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 2:17-29">2.17-29</ref> </char>). Okɛɛn baal bueel asi obi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:1-20">3.1-20</ref></char>), bɔ bueel hɛ̃ akoo k'akal dzu ke kwel a Nziã me nkuul okiool ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-31">3.21-31</ref></char>). Obobɔ, Abalayam oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 4">4</ref></char>). Baal bɛn onse Adam abɔ etumbu e Nziã, ndɛ okoo k'asuul bɔ dzu kɛn a m'okiool me bvoo ye Mãsia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 5">5</ref> </char>). Onse ãsɔɔ mã 6 ye 7, Pool owi ɛ̃mveel m'ãndɔɔ m'ãbi m'eyɛɛn ataal a Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Ndɛ osoo kal-a-kal otsɛn o Ngel, bvool obɛɛl ndiri yɔ eli «ɔ̃nsensal», eli «dzu», bvool eli «ngesɛ». Ngel esa kwɛn mbuul ayɛɛ obi ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 7:1-12">7.1-12</ref> </char>). Kɛn obi b'osa kwɛn mbuul asa obi, ke Ngel wɛ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 7:13-25">7.13-25</ref> </char>). Me b'otal Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal (8), ndɛ wu asuul bia-byɛ ekal baan a Nziã bvool awuaal a bia-byɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãsɔɔ mã 9 tiil 11 emfa ki ekieel ekal yam li Isalayel onse ɔ̃yɛɛl a Nziã kwɛn Ayuda bibi abee Nsia yi Ngesɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9:30">9.30</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:20">10.20</ref></char>). Kɛn a Nziã k'atiɔ yam e ndɛ eboo wɛ (sɔɔ li 11) bu alieel ndɔɔ yi ekieel esa ndɛ yi esa ɛ̃kam ndiri: «Yam li Isalayel lueel kieel ebvuul» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:22-26">15.22-26</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ãsɔɔ mã 12 tiil 15 ãyi nkuul mɔ̃ (forment un tout). Ntam Pool oman ɔ̃kaan a ndɛ m'ãndɔɔ m'etam ndɛ osa m'emfa ki ekal akiool onse Ebvɔɔn ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-16">12.1-16</ref> </char> ; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 13:8">13.8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:7">15.7</ref> </char>). Bvool onse baal bɛn hɛ̃ k'ali akiool wɛ ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:17">12.17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:7">13.7</ref> </char>). Ebvaan akiool asuo dzii.</para>
  <para style="io">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool ákab ndɛ bubu: Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-7">1.1-7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ɔ̃nkaan ndyam ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:8-15:13">1.8–15.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Osɛɛl: Ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ Pool mi odzuu y'ɛ̃bio ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15.14–16.27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi etsal Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia. Nziã áti mɛ̃ mbel me ndɔɔ yi ekal ntam, bvool ásueel mɛ̃ m'otsal o Nsia a ndɛ yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ, yɛn tsɔɔn Nziã áwi lɔɔ m'ɛ̃nywã mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ, onse Ɛ̃nkaan mi ngel. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Nsia oyɔ etal Muaan a ndɛ, wu opal onse yam e David, m'emfa ki ombuul. <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal osuul ndɛ Muaan a Nziã ye waan lueel, m'oseel b'éseel ndɛ ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. Ndɛ ondɛ Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Me nkuul a ndɛ, Nziã osio mɛ̃ nyiĩ yi ekal ntam, m'osa kwɛn, me nkuũ a ndɛ, baal b'ɛ̃kiri mvieel akiool ndɛ bvool alweel ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ɔ̃kiri a byɛ hɛ̃ oli onse ɛ̃kiri omyɛ̃, byɛ b'éti Yeso Mãsia mbel. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Byɛ bueel b'ekal ke bviil li Lom, bɛn Nziã ádzii byɛ bvool áti byɛ mbel k'ekal ba ngel, mɛ̃ nswɛn byɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ asio byɛ nyiĩ, awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pool odzii k'ayetal akiool ba Lom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, mɛ̃ mveel Nziã a mɛ̃ ãtuɛɛn me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia me ndɔɔ a byɛ bueel, ke ngwel wɛ abeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ okiool o byɛ m'ɔ̃kiri wueel. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mɛ̃ ebelɔ byɛ kɛn olɔ onse ãbuɛɛn ã mɛ̃. Nziã wɛn mɛ̃ ebesa ɔ̃sal a ndɛ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ŋ'ebetsal mɛ̃ Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi etal Muaan a ndɛ, oyɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn otaa-taa. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ãlio mbueel onse ãbuɛɛn ã mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ebesɔɔ ola Nziã kwɛn, okɛɛn ndɛ odzii, mɛ̃ mbɔɔ mpwee yi eyetal byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndi y'efua kyam ki emwɛn byɛ, kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ kab li nyiĩ a Nziã, li efa ol'Ɔ̃fel, kwɛn byɛ ewam, <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />bvool kwɛn ŋ'ètɔ mɛ̃ ola byɛ, bia-byɛ bueel ekal ye mpɛn: Mɛ̃ nkal ye mpɛn m'okiool o byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekal ye mpɛn m'okiool o mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Andoo, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ebee ndɔɔ yi odzɛɛn: Nsa bibi mɛ̃ ebekuru k'eya ola byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ebɔɔ nsia ke kwɛ ola byɛ, onge be mbɔɔ yɔ onse ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam. Kɛn a tiil meba, abekii mɛ̃ k'eya. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'ebiin ki Agelek, ye ki bɛn k'Agelek wɛ, ye ki anga-ãyal, ye ki ewool. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ nzii bam hɛ̃ k'etsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ ola byɛ, byɛ b'eli ke Lom.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waan e Nsia yi Ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ndi y'opfuru o Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ: Yɔ eli waan e Nziã lɛn me lɔ, ndɛ abvuul mbuul wueel wu akiool, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel Ɔ̃yuda, ke mbee wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nsia yi Ngesɛ esuo emfa ki esuul Nziã baal dzu ke nkwel a ndɛ: Eli me nkuul a okiool, eluɔ ekyam pyɛ, kɛn m'okiool, onge b'ákel ndiri: «Mbuul wu akal dzu m'okiool akal y'elaã.»<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baal afoo otaa-taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, fa ywel, mpuru a Nziã, ebemɔɔn nkal a baal b'aywɛn onziã, bvool nkal a baal bɛn k'ali dzu wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, bɔ abefoo otaa-taa. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ndɔɔ yɛn ekoo m'oyɛɛ me b'otal Nziã, eli kal-a-kal ola bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã ndyam wu osuo bɔ yɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mwɛn ébuo Nziã ɔ̃kiri, emfa e ndɛ wu Nziã, bvɛn k'ebemɔɔn me mviil wɛ, eli bvi: waan e ndɛ li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu y'onziã o ndɛ. Bvɛ ebemɔɔn kal-a-kal ŋɛn mbuul abwɛɛl eluɔ bvi ébuo ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. Obobɔ, bɔ k'abɔɔ odzeel bam wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ ayɛɛ Nziã, bɔ k'alweel ndɛ onge Nziã wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ k'abveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ amaadziɔɔn onse ãtsam mɛn otsɛn pyɛ, ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ hɛ̃ mi ɛ̃ywɛn ãyal ɛ̃li onse empeel. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Bɔ abetsam ndiri bɔ ali anga-ãyal, kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ anga-laa. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ke mboo yi alweel Nziã wɛn k'akwa wɛ bvool wu oluul me dzuun, bɔ alweel etiɔ bvi m'emfa e mbuul wu akwa, bvi m'emfa bvi anywɛn, bvi m'emfa bvi anyam b'ɛ̃mpal ɛ̃nã, ye b'adzuu me bal. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Nziã oyiri bɔ onse ãndɔɔ mã mbiin, bvool onse efua bvi ebi-ebi bvi ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, kwɛn bɔ awa ãnzuru ã bam opfuru bam-a-bam, <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />bɔ b'aswɛɛl otaa-taa o Nziã me mfya, alweel eluɔ bvi ébuo Nziã, m'obuɛɛn o bvɛ, ke mboo yi ekeelweel bɔ Nziã wu ábuo ɔ̃kiri, ndɛ wu obvaan me lweel ɔ̃bu nkal a ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Nziã oyiri bɔ onse efua bvi opfuru. Obobɔ, akal a bɔ hɛ̃ aswɛɛl emfa ki obvool o ntal, bu ayii abvool yɔ y'anga-buru b'akaal. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Emfa kiki, abɔɔl hɛ̃ ayiri emfa ki ngesɛ ki obvool o ntal, aluul m'efua onse bam-a-bam, bu abvi ãndɔɔ m'opfuru osa onse bam-a-bam abɔɔl. M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ abɔɔ furu li ekoo m'odziɔɔn o bɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Onge bɛn bɔ amwɛn kwɛn oyɛɛ o Nziã k'oli y'otsɛn wɛ, Nziã oyiri bɔ onse owool-a-wool o bɔ, kwɛn bɔ asa ãndɔɔ mɛn k'ãli me nkuul wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Bɔ aluul m'ɛ̃sal mvieel myɛn k'ɛ̃li dzu wɛ, m'ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi, me pfuul o nzi, bɔ asa bakyɛ obi, aluul m'ɔ̃tam, m'ãtsam m'obam o baal, m'obel ye pfuru. Bɔ asa ãndɔɔ mã ngwel-a-ngwel, bɔ ali anga-kwee. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Bɔ abeyɛɛn obi. Bɔ ali ataal a Nziã, bɔ bvɛɛ o mbuul pyɛ, bɔ ali y'ondɛɛl o nzuru, bɔ abeŋaã, bɔ ali y'ãyal mbueel m'asa obi, bɔ lweel li aburu a bɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Bɔ ãyal pyɛ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndɔɔ k'asa yɔ wɛ, bɔ y'ɛ̃kwal mpɛn, bɔ nyiĩ a mbuul pyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Bɔ ayɛɛ emfa ki dzu ki etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, kyɛn b'asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ebvaan akwa. Okyam ŋ'eyɛɛ bɔ obobɔ, bɔ k'ayɔɔl k'asa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ wɛ, bvool asia-mpaa ye bakyɛ hɛ̃ b'abesa mɔ̃.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nziã atsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, yɛ wu abebam bakyɛ me mbyel, okyam ŋɛn yɛ li ke nã, yɛ k'abɔɔ odzeel wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ebebam yɛ bakyɛ me mbyel, yɛ hɛ̃ ŋ'abebam nzuru a yam me mbyel, ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ wu abebam bakyɛ me mbyel, yɛ hɛ̃ abesa ãndɔɔ mamã. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã atsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki otaa-taa, me ndɔɔ a baal b'abesa ãndɔɔ mã m'emfa okyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Yɛ wu abebam bakyɛ me mbyel, kɛn a yam hɛ̃ abesa ãndɔɔ mamã, yɛ bu atsam wɛn yɛ olɔ pal onse otsiil b'etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Yɛ apfiɔɔl obvɛ o Nziã b'onduru ɔ̃ndel, y'osɛ-mwiĩ o ndɛ, y'ongesɛ o ndɛ? Yɛ adzɛɛn wɛn obvɛ o Nziã obvaan obiri yɛ k'okaal b'ɔ̃kwal? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Onge bɛn yɛ li y'ɔ̃tswɛ mpɛn, bvool bee bam k'akaal ɔ̃kwal, yɛ ŋ'adzuru mpuru a Nziã yi kokɔ nkal a yam, me tsoo li èyiool mpuru a ndɛ bvool li ètsiil ndɛ ãndɔɔ ã baal m'emfa ki dzu. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Ndɛ akieel awa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ki ebvaan mi ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:13">Ãnz 62.13</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Ãmb 24.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ndɛ akieel awa elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu ola baal bɛn m'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ a bɔ onse osa o ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ, abii lweel, ye dzuun, y'eluɔ bvɛn k'ebii wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Kɛn a ndɛ akieel asuo mpuru y'ongɛɛ o ndɛ nkal a baal bɛn, me ndɔɔ ãtsam ã bam, abee otaa-taa bvool akuru nzuru m'obi. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Fool y'ãwua ekieel eya nkal a mbuul wueel wu asa obi, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel nkal Ɔ̃yuda, ke mbee nkal a wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Lweel, ye dzuun, y'opi ekieel eya ola mbuul wueel wu asa obvɛ, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ol'Ɔ̃yuda, ola mbuul wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ola Nziã ɔ̃bɛɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn baal bueel b'asi obi ŋɛn Ngel k'eli wɛ, k'àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ me nkuul a Ngel wɛ, b'asi obi ke nsɛn a Ngel, àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã bɔ me nkuul a Ngel. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, b'ekieel esuul Nziã dzu, ke baal b'ayoo Ngel wɛ, b'ekieel esuul ndɛ dzu b'akiaal yɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ŋɛn baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bɛn k'ali ye Ngel wɛ, abesa ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel osa me bam, bɔ ali Ngel a bam, onkyam ŋɛn bɔ k'ali ye Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />M'epfuũ e bɔ, bɔ ŋ'asuo kwɛn ndɔɔ yi etam Ngel osa, akel yɔ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ. Ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃suo obobɔ, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ãtsam ã bɔ ãlio makyɛ ãfɛn bɔ, ãlio makyɛ ãtsweel bɔ, <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal mã m'edziɔɔn me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia, onge b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ onse Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ebetsal mɛ̃.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oywɛn o lweel b'Isalayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Yɛ wu abeyɛɛn wɛn yɛ li Ɔ̃yuda, yɛ wu abeta kaã me Ngel, yɛ wu abebɛɛl ntwel me Nziã, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />yɛ wu yɛɛ b'edzii ndɛ, bvool wu yɛɛ k'asuaal ndɔɔ yi nkiin, me ndɔɔ yɛn Ngel esuo yɛ nkuul, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />yɛ wu atsam wɛn yɛ li mbiri a ɛ̃nkwa-mviil, oyɔɔl o b'ali onse empeel, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />Yɛ wɛn yɛ li ɔ̃yiool a ewool, ɔ̃tee a baan b'abwee, ɔ̃tswɛ-pa wɛn yɛ bam atsam wɛn onse Ngel, yɛ li ye oyɛɛ y'otaa-taa m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />obobɔ yɛ wu abeyiool bakyɛ, kɛn a yɛ k'abeyiool nzuru a yam wɛ, yɛ abetee bakyɛ wɛn abee oturu, kɛn a yam abeturu! <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Yɛ abeyɛɛn wɛn k'ebvaan awal ɔ̃lam wuo ɔ̃kal a mbuul wɛ, kɛn a yam abewal alam wuo akaal a baal! Yɛ li ye byal li etiɔ, kɛn a yɛ abekuaal bvi eli onse ãnzɔ m'etiɔ! <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Yɛ abɛɛl ntwel me Ngel, kɛn a yɛ k'alweel Nziã wɛ ŋ'efel yɛ Ngel. <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ngwnyã, ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, ndiri: «Me ndɔɔ a byɛ, abefiɛɛn nkuũ a Nziã onse ɛ̃kiri myɛn k'ɛ̃yɛɛ Nziã wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Edz 52.5</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Ke yam, otsiil o nzuru oli y'otsɛn o bɔ, okɛɛn yɛ asa m'etam Ngel osa. Kɛn okɛɛn yɛ afel Ngel, onkyam ŋ'átsiil yɛ, yɛ yii onge mbuul wɛn k'átsiil wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn mbuul wɛn k'átsiil wɛ osi m'etam Ngel osa, olɔ k'awel ndɛ onge mbuul wu átsiil wɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Mbuul wɛn k'átsiil ndɛ m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ, wu afel Ngel, ndɛ kieel k'atsiil ãndɔɔ ã yɛ wɛ, yɛ wɛn k'akiaal Ngel wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn yɛ li ye Ngel yi ákel bvool átsiil yɛ? <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Ɔ̃yuda wa taa-taa, ke wu oli Ɔ̃yuda m'emfa ki onkwel-a-nzi wɛ. Otsiil o nzuru hɛ̃ bo bɔ-a-bɔ, ke b'onkwel-a-nzi me nzuru wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Ɔ̃yuda wa ndɛ-a-ndɛ, wu oli Ɔ̃yuda m'edziɔɔn. Otsiil o nzuru o ndɛ oli b'ɔ̃kwal, bɛn k'ofi me Ngel yi ákel wɛ, ofi m'Ɔ̃fel. Mbuul wa m'emfa okyɛ, dzuun e ndɛ k'efa ola baal wɛ, dzuun e ndɛ efa ola Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Obobɔ, bvel li akal Ɔ̃yuda emã, wuo otsɛn b'otsiil o nzuru omã? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Bvel eli boo-boo m'ãndɔɔ mbueel. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ baal bɛn áwi bɔ ãyɛɛn ã Nziã ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn baal bakyɛ onse bɔ akwɛɛn k'akuru nzuru me Nziã, ŋ'ekwɛɛn bɔ k'akuru nzuru me Nziã ol'osi kwɛn Nziã akwɛɛn k'asa b'élieel ndɛ ndiri àsa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Yɔɔl kwɛn baal ayɛɛ kwɛn Nziã abeyɛɛn otaa-taa, baal ali anga-mfya, onge b'ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Ebvaan baal ayɛɛ kwɛn yɛ li dzu onse ãyɛɛn ã yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">bvool yɛ abii ŋ'abva yɛ mbal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:6">Ãnz 51.6</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Kɛn okɛɛn obi b'esa bia-byɛ osuo kwɛn Nziã oli dzu, oŋɔ̃ bia-byɛ omã oyɛɛn? Ŋɛn Nziã k'ali dzu wɛ, ŋ'ebal ndɛ mpuru ye bia-byɛ? Ke yam, mɛ̃ ŋã eyɛɛn m'emfa ki eyɛɛn baal. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn obobɔ, Nziã ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃kiri kieel bwɛn-a-bwɛn atsiil mɔ̃? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Kɛn okɛɛn mfya a mbuul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ, ákel ndiri «mfya a mɛ», ke ndɛ oli ye mfya wɛ, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri baal ali ye mfya.</char></note> esuo kwɛn Nziã bam ayɛɛn otaa-taa, me ndɔɔ a lweel e ndɛ, obobɔ otsɛn omã bvool b'awa mbuul etumbu onge nga-ãbi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Al'ekoo m'oyɛɛn wɛn: «Bia-byɛ esa obi, kwɛn obvɛ opal onse oŋɔ̃!» Anga-kwee b'abeburu bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Anga-kwee obɔ abvaan abɔɔ etumbu.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuul wa dzu ke mviil ã Nziã pyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Oŋɔ̃ omã eyɛɛn? Bee b'Ayuda, enduru bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, bee emeesuo wɛn Ayuda ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bueel ali ke nsɛn okwɛn b'obi, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />onge b'ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Mbuul wa dzu pyɛ, onkyam ngɔmɔ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Nga-ãyal pyɛ, onkyam ngɔmɔ̃ wu abii Nziã k'ali wɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bɔ bueel adzɛɛn nkuul, ekuu emɔ̃ adziɔɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">ngɔmɔ̃ wu asa obvɛ pyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">onkyam ngɔmɔ̃ ndyam pyɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Ngwɔɔn-a-bwel a bɔ oli onge mpiɛɛn yi ekal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">elam e bɔ li abepfuru baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Ebwel e bɔ eli y'ɔ̃twɔɔ a mpel.<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Ɔ̃nywã a bɔ oluul m'obwel o baal enkɛɛ ye nkaa.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />Ntaã e bɔ eli yɛɛ m'oyetsal b'ãkel.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Bɔ abesiil obiil ye fool m'ãmboo mbueel m'ebwel bɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Nkuul yi opi, bɔ k'ayɛɛ yɔ wɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Obal o Nziã k'oli ke nkwel a bɔ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Ãnz 14.1-3</ref>; </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 5:10">5.10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn mbueel m'eyɛɛn Ngel, yɔ eyɛɛn mɔ̃ me baal b'ali ke nsɛn a Ngel, kwɛn ɔ̃nywã wueel akal embob, bvool kwɛn ɔ̃kiri wueel abva m'ɔ̃dzoo ke mviil ã Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ kieel k'akal dzu m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Ngel wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn, ndɔɔ yi esa Ngel, kɛn a yɛn baal ayɛɛ obi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki esuul Nziã baal dzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Kɛn a meba, Nziã osuul bia-byɛ dzu, onge b'etsweel ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Ngel ye mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Ndɛ k'abwel me Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nziã osuul baal bueel dzu ŋ'elɔ bɔ okiool onse Yeso Mãsia. Ke ngwel wɛ okam k'oli onse baal wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bueel asi obi, bu asyel lala ye lweel e Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Kɛn a Nziã me nyiĩ a ndɛ osuul bɔ dzu ngwel, m'obvuul b'ebvuul ndɛ bɔ me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Ndɛ wu éwi Nziã onge kab me ndɔɔ yi adzeel ãbi m'ãkel ã ndɛ, me nkuul a okiool. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã osuo kwɛn ndɛ oli dzu, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ k'áwi baal b'ási obi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn etumbu wɛ, <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />m'osɛ-mwiĩ o ndɛ. Ndɛ ádzii k'asuo kwɛn ndɛ oli dzu me lio li, me ndɔɔ yi akal dzu, ŋ'esuul ndɛ mbuul wu olɔ okiool onse Yeso dzu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Obobɔ, ndɔɔ yi abɛɛl ntwel me yɔ bvool eli? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, ambaal yɔ! Ambaal yɔ me ngel yɛn? Me ngel yi ɛ̃sal? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Me ngel yi okiool. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bee emwɛn wɛn, mbuul akal dzu m'okiool o ndɛ, ke me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Ngel wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Nziã oli kɛn a Nziã a Ayuda? Ndɛ k'ali hɛ̃ wa baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ wɛ? Ngwanyã, ndɛ oli hɛ̃ Nziã a baal b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃nkyam. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Onge bɛn Nziã oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, ndɛ wu asuul baal b'átsiil dzu m'okiool o bɔ, bvool wu asuul bɛn k'átsiil wɛ dzu me nkuul okiool o bɔ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebam Ngel me nkuul a okiool? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Bia-byɛ Ngel bvɛɛ ewa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo yi Abalayam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Obobɔ, omã eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ Abalayam wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ? Ki ébɔɔ ndɛ me mpɛn a ndyam emã? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Okɛɛn Nziã ásuul Abalayam mbuul wa dzu me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ, ŋɛn ndɛ ale akoo m'obɛɛl o ntwel, kɛn a ke ke nkwel a Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn bubu: «Abalayam áli y'okiool me Nziã. Nziã bu asiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Obɛ 15.6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Mbuul wu osi ɔ̃sal, furu e ndɛ k'asiɔɔl lɔ onge nyiĩ yi asio ndɛ wɛ, furu lɛn ebvaan awa ndɛ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu esi ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Me b'otal mbuul wɛn k'asi ɔ̃sal wɛ, ŋɛn ndɛ olɔ okiool onse Nziã wu asuul nga-ãbi dzu, okiool o ndɛ osa kwɛn Nziã asiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Emfa kiki, me ndɔɔ esɛ ki eli a mbuul wɛn, ke m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Ngel wɛ, Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu, David olieel bubu:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />«Esɛ ola baal bɛn Nziã ombaal bɔ elyal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">odzeel bɔ ãbi!<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Esɛ ola mbuul wɛn Mfam bam k'abesiɔɔl ãbi ã ndɛ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Ãnz 32.1-2</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Esɛ okyɛ kɛn a ki baal b'átsiil, wuo ki bɛn hɛ̃ k'átsiil wɛ? Ke ngwel wɛ, bee eyɛɛn wɛn «me ndɔɔ Abalayam, okiool o ndɛ osi kwɛn Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu.» <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Lio emã li ésiɔɔl Nziã okiool o ndɛ? Ŋ'al'amaatsiil ndɛ, wuo ŋɛn ale kɛn atsiil ndɛ wɛ? Ke ŋ'amaatsiil wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn ale kɛn atsiil ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Abalayam obɔɔ otsiil o nzuru onge eliĩ. Kyɛ esuo kwɛn Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu m'okiool, ye k'atsiil ndɛ. Obobɔ, ndɛ oli tal a baal bueel b'akiool, onkyam ŋɛn k'atsiil bɔ wɛ, kwɛn Nziã asiɔɔl bɔ hɛ̃ onge baal ba dzu. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ oli tal a b'átsiil, bɛn k'asɛn kɛn a m'otsiil b'átsiil bɔ wɛ, kɛn a bɔ hɛ̃ aluɛɛn kuul e nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ Abalayam wu ákiool ye k'atsiil ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndɔɔ yi élieel Nziã ndiri àsa yi abɔɔ m'okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã ŋ'áwi Abalayam y'atiɔɔl a ndɛ lɔɔ li awal ɔ̃swal wu ɔ̃kiri ondɛ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn Abalayam ákieel Ngel wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã ásiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu m'okiool. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn b'abɔɔ eluɔ bvi eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri àwa baal, eli kɛn a b'akiaal Ngel, ŋɛn okiool k'obekal y'otsɛn wɛ, bvool oyɛɛn b'eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri ndɛ àwa baal eluɔ hɛ̃ oyii bo ngwel. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ngel epoo mpuru a Nziã, mboo yɛn Ngel pyɛ, ofel o Ngel hɛ̃ k'oli wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, abɔɔ bvi eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri awa baal me nkuul a okiool, oyɔ eli nyiĩ a Nziã. M'emfa okyɛ, oyɛɛn obɔ otal atiɔɔl b'Abalayam bueel, ekal b'ali ye Ngel, ekal b'ali y'okiool onge Abalayam, ndɛ wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ bueel. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Ákel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nsuul yɛ nkiɔɔn a ãyam ã baal booboo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Obɛ 17.5</ref></char></note>.» Abalayam oli nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ ke nkwel a Nziã wu elɔ ndɛ okiool onse ndɛ, ndɛ wu Nziã wu aseel b'ákwi-ákwi, bvool asa kwɛn eluɔ bvɛn k'eli wɛ, ekal. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ke mboo yɛn Abalayam kaã ale k'ekekal wɛ, ndɛ oti kaã kɛn ota. Ndɛ bu ayii nkiɔɔn a ãyam ã baal bibi, onge b'élieel Nziã ndiri: «Atiɔɔl a yɛ akieel akal bam bibi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Obɛ 15.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ aleyii me mvel sua ɔ̃nkam (100), bvool nzuru a ndɛ al'emeewɔɔl yam bibi, Sala hɛ̃ ale k'akoo m'oburu wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ nzuru al'emeewɔɔl, Abalayam k'ayɔɔl okiool wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Ke nkwel oyɛɛn b'eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri ndɛ àwa ndɛ muaan, Abalayam k'ati enkyam wɛ. Kɛn okiool o ndɛ owi ndɛ mpɛn, ndɛ bu alweel Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ndɛ bam áli ye kaã kwɛn, lɔɔ li ewa Nziã, ndɛ asa kwɛn lɔ ekoo. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, «Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu.» <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: «Nziã osiɔɔl ndɛ onge mbuul wa dzu», ke kɛn a me ndɔɔ a ndyam sii wɛ, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ hɛ̃. Bia-byɛ bɛn Nziã asiɔɔl onge baal ba dzu, nzal-a-ŋɛn bia-byɛ elɔ okiool onse ndɛ wu áseel Yeso wu Mfam a bia-byɛ, onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Nziã ási kwɛn ndɛ akwa me ndɔɔ ãbi ã bia-byɛ, bvool áseel ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi asuul bia-byɛ dzu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Obvool b'ondoo ye Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Onge bɛn Nziã osuul bia-byɛ dzu m'okiool, bia-byɛ eli onse opi ye ndɛ, me nkuul a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Eli me nkuul a ndɛ wu Yeso k'ebɔɔ bia-byɛ mpwee yi esam onse nyiĩ a Nziã m'okiool, nyiĩ yi esɛn bia-byɛ ãnã onse yɔ, bvool bia-byɛ eli y'esɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ eli ye kaã li esam onse lweel e Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ bvool yɛn, bia-byɛ eli y'esɛ hɛ̃ me fool li emwɛn bia-byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn fool esa kwɛn mbuul akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />osɛ-mwiĩ osa kwɛn mbuul abvel onse ɔ̃mbio. Obvel onse ɔ̃mbio osa kwɛn mbuul akal ye kaã. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, kaã olɔ k'ewa mbuul opfuru wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã oyiri dzii e ndɛ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-byɛ me nkuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu éwi ndɛ bia-byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'éli bia-byɛ kɛn pɛn pyɛ, Mãsia okwi me ndɔɔ anga-ãbi, me lio li éwɛɛ Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Eli bam ye fool kwɛn mbuul akwa me ndɔɔ a mbuul wa dzu. Owɛɛl mbuul okoo k'akiool k'akwa me ndɔɔ a mbuul wu asa obvɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Kɛn emfa ki esuo Nziã dzii e ndɛ ola bia-byɛ kyɛ-ki: Ŋ'éli bia-byɛ kɛn baal b'ãbi, Mãsia okwi me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Onge bɛn meba bia-byɛ eyii baal ba dzu m'ãkel ã Mãsia, bvel-bvel bia-byɛ èbvuul me mpuru a Nziã, me nkuul a ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn ŋ'éli bia-byɛ kɛn ataal a Nziã, ndɛ obveel ondoo ye bia-byɛ m'epfu e Muaan a ndɛ, bvel-bvel ŋ'emeebvool ondoo o bia-byɛ ye ndɛ, bia-byɛ ekieel ebvuul m'elaã e Muaan a ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Ndɔɔ yinkyɛ yɛn, bia-byɛ eli y'esɛ me Nziã, me ndɔɔ a Yeso Mãsia, wɛn meba me nkuul a ndɛ ondoo o bia-byɛ ye Nziã obvool.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãdam ye Yeso Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn me nkuul a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ obi osam onse ɔ̃kiri, bvool me nkuul a obi, epfu hɛ̃ esam onse ɔ̃kiri, emfa kiki hɛ̃ epfu etɔ ola baal bueel, ke ngwel wɛ baal bueel asi obi. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, tiil ye k'éwi Nziã Moyize Ngel, obi óli onse ɔ̃kiri. Kɛn a ŋɛn Ngel pyɛ, k'asiɔɔl obi wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Kɛn a fa lio li Ãdam tiil lio li Moyize, epfu éli y'okwɛn, onkyam nkal a baal bɛn k'ási obi bɛn onge b'ési Ãdam wɛ. Ãdam oli emfa ngemɔ̃ ye wu áyi.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Kɛn okam oli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a kab li ngwel y'obi. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn me ndɔɔ obi o mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal ákwi, bvel-bvel nyiĩ a Nziã ye kab li ngwel li eyi me mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, eli yam ngamfɛn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal. Mbuul ondɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Okam oli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ kab olɔ y'obi o mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã áwi baal etumbu me ndɔɔ obi o mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. Kɛn onkyam ŋɛn baal asi ɔ̃bɔbɔ wu ãbi, kab e Nziã esuul bɔ dzu. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, me ndɔɔ a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, bvool me ndɔɔ obi o mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ondɛ, epfu eyii y'okwɛn nkal a baal bueel, bvel-bvel baal b'abɔɔ ɔ̃bɔbɔ a nyiĩ a Nziã ye kab li esuul ndɛ bɔ dzu, àkal y'okwɛn onse elaã me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia ndyam sii. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Obobɔ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn elyal ngemɔ̃ ebiri baal bueel k'etumbu, emfa kiki hɛ̃ ndɔɔ yi dzu ngamɔ̃ esuul baal bueel dzu, kwɛn bɔ akal y'elaã. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn m'ofel o Ngel o mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal ayii anga-ãbi, emfa kiki hɛ̃ me lweel e mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asuul ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal dzu. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Onkie Ngel éyi me ndɔɔ yɛn obi okal bibi. Kɛn a mboo yi eli obi bibi, nyiĩ a Nziã eyii yam ngamfɛn. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Obobɔ, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn obi oli y'okwɛn b'obiri o baal k'epfu, emfa kiki hɛ̃ nyiĩ a Nziã eli y'okwɛn b'osuul baal dzu, kwɛn bia-byɛ ebɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, me nkuul a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okwa me ndɔɔ obi, okal mwiĩ ye Yeso Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ omã eyɛɛn? Bia-byɛ ekal onse obi kɛn okal ke nkwel a Nziã, kwɛn nyiĩ a Nziã ekal yam ngamfɛn? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Bia-byɛ b'emeekwa me ndɔɔ obi, emfa emã ki ekal bia-byɛ bvool onse obi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Byɛ edzɛɛn wɛn, bia-byɛ bueel b'éwel opongo o Yeso Mãsia, bia-byɛ ŋ'éwel hɛ̃ opongo b'epfu e ndɛ? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />M'opongo b'epfu e Mãsia obɔ, ádziool bia-byɛ ye ndɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ésiool ndɛ me waan e Taal, bya-byɛ hɛ̃ edzuu onse elaã li alili. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ eyii nzuru ngamɔ̃ ye ndɛ m'epfu lɛn onge li ndɛ. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, bia-byɛ bam eyɛɛ wɛn bia-byɛ ekieel ekal, nzuru ngamɔ̃ ye ndɛ m'osiool bɛn onge bo ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ombuul o bia-byɛ b'otsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, ábɛɛl bɔ m'enkulusu ye Mãsia, kwɛn nzuru a bia-byɛ yi obi ebii, bvool kwɛn bia-byɛ ebee ankyal b'obi bvool obekal. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu okwi, obi k'obekal y'okwɛn nkal a ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Kɛn onge bɛn bia-byɛ emeekwa ye Mãsia, bia-byɛ ekiool bam wɛn bia-byɛ ekieel ekal hɛ̃ y'elaã ye ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Bia-byɛ eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, Mãsia ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi: Ndɛ bvool k'àbekwa bam wɛ. Obobɔ, epfu bvool k'èbekal bam y'okwɛn nkal a ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ okwi, ndɛ me ndɔɔ obi o baal akwi nsa ngamɔ̃ ɔ̃bu. Okɛɛn ndɛ oli mwiĩ, ndɛ oli mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Obobɔ, ewal byam onge baal b'amaakwa me ndɔɔ obi, bvool b'ali mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a Nziã, onse Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, obi bvool k'obvaan obekal y'okwɛn nkal nzuru a byɛ yi ekieel ekwa wɛ. Obobɔ, ebee bvi etam efua e yɔ osa. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Ebee elyam e nzuru a byɛ si ngemɔ̃ ke nsɛn okwɛn b'obi osuul, onge eluɔ ki esa byɛ ãndɔɔ mɛn k'ãli dzu wɛ me kyɛ. Kɛn ekab nzuru a byam ola Nziã, onge baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ b'asiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi. Esuul nzuru a byɛ yueel ekal yi Nziã, onge eluɔ ki asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu me kyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, obi k'òbekal y'okwɛn nkal a byɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'ebekal ke nsɛn a Ngel wɛ, meba byɛ eli ke nsɛn a okwɛn o nyiĩ a Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkyal a ãndɔɔ mã dzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Obobɔ, omã eyɛɛn? Bia-byɛ esa obi me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-a-byɛ k'eli ke nsɛn a Ngel wɛ, eli ke nsɛn a okwɛn o nyiĩ a Nziã? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Byɛ bam eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, ŋ'esuul byɛ nzuru a byɛ ke nsɛn okwɛn o mbuul m'olweel o ndɛ, byɛ ŋ'eyii ankyal a mbuul wu elweel byɛ ondɛ. Byɛ elweel obi, bɔ obiri byɛ k'epfu, byɛ elweel Nziã, ndɛ abiri byɛ k'ãndɔɔ mã dzu. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn bia-byɛ elweel Nziã! Ke ngwel wɛ byɛ tsɔɔn éli ankyal b'obi. Meba byɛ elweel ãtee m'átee baal bueel ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, bvool m'éyɔɔ byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Onge bɛn apaal byɛ onse obi, byɛ eyii ankyal b'ãndɔɔ mã dzu.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn m'emfa ki eyɛɛn baal, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ eli ye fool m'okwaal b'otsɛn. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ éwi elyam e nzuru a byɛ onge ankyal m'osa b'ãndɔɔ mã mbiin y'obi, m'osiɛɛn k'obi. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, meba, ekab elyam e nzuru a byɛ onge ankyal b'ãndɔɔ mã dzu, m'osiɛɛn k'omwiĩ b'edzii Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'éli byɛ ankyal b'obi, osa b'ãndɔɔ mã dzu k'óketal byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Bvel emã li ébɔɔ byɛ ŋ'ési byɛ ãndɔɔ mã mbiin omɔ̃ y'obi obɔ? Bvel pyɛ! Kɛn a meba ŋã, byɛ eli y'opfuru ŋ'ési byɛ mɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɔ̃ ãbiri k'epfu. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Kɛn a meba, onge bɛn apaal byɛ onse obi, bvool byɛ eyii ankyal a Nziã, bvel li ebɔɔ byɛ eli omwiĩ b'edzii Nziã, bɛn ntɔ a bɔ eli elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, furu li obi, eli epfu, kɛn a kab li ngwel li ewa Nziã baal, eli elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu li onse Yeso Mãsia, wu Mfam a bia-byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kiool k'abekal ke nsɛn okwɛn o Ngel wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Andoo a dzii, byɛ bam k'edzɛɛn b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn byɛ eyɛɛ Ngel: Ngel eli y'okwɛn nkal a mbuul lio lueel li eli mbuul ondɛ mwiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />M'emfa kiki, ngel a bal ebvool ɔ̃kaal a bal y'ɔ̃lam lio lueel li eli ɔ̃lam ondɛ mwiĩ. Ŋ'ekwi ɔ̃lam, ɔ̃kal k'abekal ke nsɛn a ngel yi ekebvool ndɛ y'ɔ̃lam wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Obobɔ, ŋ'eli ɔ̃lam kɛn mwiĩ, okɛɛn ɔ̃kal oyii wa bɔɔl ekyam, ayɛɛn ndiri ndɛ owel anga-ɔ̃lam. Kɛn a ŋɛn ɔ̃lam okwi, ndɛ k'abekal ke nsɛn a ngel a bal wɛ. Okɛɛn ndɛ oyii ɔ̃kal a bɔɔl ekyam, ŋɛn ndɛ k'awel anga-ɔ̃lam wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, andoo a dzii, me nkuul a nzuru a Mãsia, ábam byɛ me b'otal Ngel, kwɛn byɛ ekal ba mbuul ɔ̃kyam, wu ásiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi. M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ eburu nsia me ndɔɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'éli bia-byɛ ke nsɛn okwɛn b'ombuul, efua bvi ãbi ékesal me nkuul a Ngel onse elyam e nzuru a bia-byɛ, m'emfa kyɛn bia-byɛ ékeburu nsia yi ebiri k'epfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Kɛn a meba, bia-byɛ k'ebekal ke nsɛn okwɛn o Ngel wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ emeekwa me b'otal Ngel oyɔ yi ekesuul bia-byɛ m'onkyal. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ esal ke nsɛn okwɛn b'alili b'Ɔ̃fel, ke ke nsɛn okwɛn o Ngel yi ákel yi émeefa mfel wɛ.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsɛn o Ngel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ omã eyɛɛn? Ngel eli obi? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Kɛn a mɛ̃ ŋe ngyɛɛ obi me nkuul a Ngel. M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ k'ekeeyɛɛ efua bvi ebi-ebi wɛ, okɛɛn Ngel k'elieel mɛ̃ ndiri: «Oyɛɛ ke kal y'efua bvi ebi-ebi wɛ». <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Obobɔ, obi obɔɔ mpwee me b'etam Ngel osa, m'olɔ b'efua bvi ebi-ebi b'emfa bvieel onse mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn Ngel pyɛ, obi okwi. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Me b'otal mɛ̃, ŋ'éli Ngel tsɔɔn pyɛ, mɛ̃ éli mwiĩ. Kɛn a ŋ'eyi ndɔɔ yi etam Ngel osa, obi oyii mwiĩ, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />mɛ̃ bu nkwi. Obobɔ, ndɔɔ yi etam ngel osa yi ekeebiri mɛ̃ k'elaã, ebiri mɛ̃ k'epfu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, obi obɔɔ mpwee me b'etam Ngel osa, opfuru mɛ̃ me nkuul a bɔ, bu obam mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Ŋɛn Ngel eli ɔ̃nsensal, ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel osa hɛ̃ ãli ɔ̃nsensal, ãli dzu, bvool ãli ngesɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Obobɔ, obvɛ okɔɔl epfu me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Eli obi, bɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ omɔɔn onge obi, obwel me nkuul eluɔ ki ngesɛ, bu obiri mɛ̃ k'epfu. M'emfa okyɛ, me nkuul a m'etam Ngel osa, obi osuo kwɛn bɔ oyii bam obi-obi.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nkyal a ngel yi obi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ke yam, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn Ngel eyi m'Ɔ̃fel. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ndi kɛn a mbuul, bvool ndi ɔ̃nkyal a obi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, b'esa mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'ebɔɔ bɔ otsɛn wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn be nzii mɛ̃, mɛ̃ k'esa bɔ wɛ, kɛn a b'ebyal mɛ̃, b'esa mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Onge bɛn b'esa mɛ̃, bɛn mɛ̃ ke nzii wɛ, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ ye Ngel wɛn yɔ eli ngesɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Obobɔ, wu asa ndɔɔ oyɔ ke mɛ̃ wɛ, wu asa yɔ obi b'okal onse mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ yi mvɛ onse mɛ̃ pyɛ, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri onse ombuul o mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ nzii k'esa obvɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ mpɛn yi esa bɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Mɛ̃ k'esa obvɛ be nzii mɛ̃ wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ esa obi bɛn mɛ̃ ke nzii wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Okɛɛn bɛn mɛ̃ ke nzii wɛ, b'esa mɛ̃, ŋɛn wu asa obobɔ ke myam wɛ, obi b'okal onse mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ emwɛn ngel yi onse mɛ̃: Mɛ̃ wu nzii k'esa obvɛ, ki nkoo k'esa mɛ̃ kɛn obi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onse mwiĩ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ me ngel a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ emwɛn ngel nkyam yi esal onse nzuru a mɛ̃: Yɔ edzwaan ye ngel yi ãtsam ã mɛ̃, yɔ hɛ̃ esuul mɛ̃ ɔ̃nkyal a ngel yi obi yi eli onse nzuru a mɛ̃ yueel. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mɛ̃ mpii mbuul a fool ndi! Wu àpaal mɛ̃ onse nzuru yi ebiri mɛ̃ k'epfu yi nã? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Ãtuɛɛn ãbvool ola Nziã, me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ! M'emfa okyɛ, onse ãtsam ã mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃nkyal a ngel a Nziã, m'ombuul o mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃nkyal a ngel a obi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Omwiĩ m'emfa ki Ɔ̃fel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Obobɔ, meba etumbu si ngemɔ̃ k'ebekal wɛ, me baal b'ali bvoo ye Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'eyii mbuul bvoo ye Yeso Mãsia, ngel yi ndɛ eyii ngel yi Ɔ̃fel wu awa elaã. Ngel oyɔ epaal yɛ onse ngel a obi ye y'epfu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ngel ale k'ekoo m'osa o ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ombuul ókesuul yɔ mpɛn pyɛ, kɛn a Nziã osi yɔ: Ndɛ oyuɔɔl Muaan a ndyam, me nzuru yɛn onge yi baal b'ãbi me ndɔɔ obi, m'opaal o bɔ onse obi. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ wu Nziã owi obi b'osal onse baal etumbu. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Ndɛ osi obobɔ, kwɛn bia-byɛ esa ãndɔɔ mã dzu m'esɔɔ Ngel, bia-byɛ bɛn k'edzuu m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ, b'edzuu m'emfa ki Ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, b'akal m'emfa ki ombuul, asa m'edzii ombuul, b'akal m'emfa ki Ɔ̃fel, asa m'edzii Ɔ̃fel. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, efua bvi ombuul ebiri k'epfu, Ɔ̃fel abiri k'elaã y'opi. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ngwanyã, efua bvi ombuul eli ɔ̃taal a Nziã, bvɛ k'elweel ngel a Nziã wɛ. Bvɛ bam k'ekoo k'esa obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />B'aluɛɛn a efua bvi ombuul k'akoo k'awa Nziã esɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Me b'otal byɛ, byɛ k'eluɛɛn a efua bvi ombuul wɛ, byɛ eli ke nsɛn okwɛn b'Ɔ̃fel, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ abekal onse byɛ. Okɛɛn mbuul k'ali y'Ɔ̃fel a Mãsia wɛ, ndɛ k'ali wa ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Kɛn okɛɛn Mãsia oli onse byɛ, ngwanyã, nzuru a byɛ èkwa me ndɔɔ obi, kɛn Ɔ̃fel awa byɛ elaã, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã ámaasuul byɛ dzu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Onge bɛn Ɔ̃fel a wu áseel Yeso onse b'ákwi-ákwi akal onse byɛ, wu áseel Mãsia onse b'ákwi-ákwi àwa nzuru a byɛ yi ekieel ekwa elaã, me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel a ndɛ wu akal onse byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, andoo, bia-byɛ k'eli y'ebiin ki efua bvi ombuul wɛ, kwɛn esa ãndɔɔ m'etam efua obvɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn byɛ ekal m'emfa ki ombuul, byɛ èkwa. Kɛn a ŋɛn me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel byɛ ebam epfuũ bvi ebvi-ebvi, byɛ èkal y'elaã. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bueel b'abedzuu m'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã ali baan a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ k'éyɔɔ ɔ̃fel wu onkyal wɛ, kwɛn byɛ bvool ekal onse buɔ. Kɛn a byɛ éyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel wu ásuul byɛ eyii baan a Nziã ndyam. M'Ɔ̃fel ondɛ, bia-byɛ ebiool ndiri: Aba! Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri Taal! <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Ɔ̃fel a Nziã ndyam abetsweel ol'ɔ̃fel a bia-byɛ ndiri bia-byɛ eli baan a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Onge bɛn bia-byɛ eli baan a Nziã, ŋɛn bia-byɛ hɛ̃ èwal ɛ̃swal ɛ̃ Nziã, bia-byɛ ewal myɛ̃ ye Mãsia. Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn bia-byɛ emwɛn fool ye ndɛ, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ èsam onse lweel ye ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãmpal mã meba ye lweel li ekieel eya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn k'akoo k'amvɛɛl ãmpal mã lio li ye lweel li ekieel esuo Nziã bia-byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kiri wueel akiaal ɔ̃kwal mbaa-mbaa lio li ekieel esuo Nziã lweel e baan a ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ásuul ɔ̃kiri ke nsɛn okwɛn bɛn otsɛn pyɛ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn ndyam ádzii wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã ásuul ndɛ ke nsɛn okwɛn obɔ. Kɛn a kaã kɛn eli me ndɔɔ ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />Kaã olɔ lɛn akieel apaal ndɛ onse onkyal b'okwɛn b'obebiil ndɛ. Obobɔ, ndɛ akieel akal ndii ye baan a Nziã onse lweel li ekieel ebɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ke yam, bia-byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn tiil meba ɔ̃kiri wueel abeluɔɔl bvool abemwɛn fool, onge ɔ̃kaal wu aburu. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Ɔ̃kiri k'abeluɔɔl ndyam wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ b'eyɔɔ Ɔ̃fel onge eluɔ bvi ɛ̃kwel onse bvi eyɛɛn Nziã ndiri ndɛ awa, bia-byɛ hɛ̃ ebeluɔɔl onse ɛ̃kwal, ŋ'ebekiaal bia-byɛ kwɛn Nziã asuul bia-byɛ ekal baan a ndyam, bvool kwɛn ndɛ abvuul nzuru a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ ebvuul me kaã. Kɛn a kaã li amwɛn k'eli kaã wɛ. Ki emwɛn mbuul, ndɛ bvool ol'oti kaã me kyɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Kɛn okɛɛn bia-byɛ eta kaã m'eluɔ kyɛn k'emwɛn wɛ, bia-byɛ eta kaã y'osɛ-mwiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, Ɔ̃fel awuaal a bia-byɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ eywɛn a mpɛn. Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ k'eyɛɛ kyɛn ebvaan esɔɔ onse ãbuɛɛn wɛ. Kɛn Ɔ̃fel ndyam abebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ m'ɛ̃nduɔɔl myɛn mbuul k'akoo k'ayɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Kɛn a Nziã wu amwɛn dzio li ɛ̃kwal, oyɛɛ m'edzii Ɔ̃fel. Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃fel abebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ba ngel, m'emfa ki edzii Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Bia-byɛ bvool eyɛɛ wɛn Nziã abesa mbueel me ndɔɔ obvɛ o b'adzii ndɛ, bɔ b'éti ndɛ mbel m'emfa ki éwɛɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, b'éyɛɛ Nziã ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, ndɛ hɛ̃ áwɛɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel k'asa kwɛn bɔ akal emfa ngemɔ̃ ye Muaan a ndɛ, kwɛn Muaan a ndɛ akal muaan wu ɛ̃kwel onse baan-ngoo bibi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />B'ésueel ndɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, ndɛ hɛ̃ áti bɔ mbel. B'éti ndɛ mbel, ndɛ hɛ̃ ásuul bɔ dzu. B'ésuul ndɛ dzu, ndɛ hɛ̃ áwi bɔ lweel.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzii e Nziã ewa mpɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ bvool omã oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãndɔ omɔ̃? Onge bɛn Nziã oli ongwel a bia-byɛ, wu àbvel bia-byɛ mpɛn nã? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ndɛ k'aluo Muaan a ndyam wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ okab ndɛ me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ bueel. Me nyiĩ a ndɛ, ndɛ k'àwa bia-byɛ bvieel ye ndɛ hɛ̃ wɛ? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Wu àfɛn b'ésueel Nziã nã? Nziã wu asuul bɔ dzu. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Wu àwa bɔ etumbu nã? Ke ngwel wɛ, wu okwi Yeso! Bvel-bvel, ndɛ osiool. Ndɛ oli me kuɔɔl e Nziã ki elam, bvool abebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Wu akieel akab bia-byɛ ye dzii e Mãsia nã? Fool? Ãwua? Otuaal o mpal? Nzal? Oywal? Etsam? Epwel? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />M'emfa ki ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Me ndɔɔ a yɛ, abebam bee tsoo bwɛn a tsoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Abewal bee onge emɛmɛɛ̃ bvi atiɛɛn ãbwel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Ãnz 44.23</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Kɛn onse ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel, bia-byɛ bam ebvel mpɛn, me nkuul a wu ádzii bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ bam nkiool wɛn, ekal epfu, ekal omwiĩ, ekal ãnzwel, ekal ãkwɛn, ekal ãndɔɔ mã nonɔ̃, ekal ãndɔɔ m'ãya, ekal waan, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ekal ãkwɛn mã ke ywel, ekal mã ke nsɛn a nsie, ekal eluɔ ekyam ki ébuo Nziã, k'eli y'eluɔ ki èkab bia-byɛ ye dzii e Nziã li esuo ndɛ onse Yeso Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Nziã bwɛn yam e ndɛ li esueel ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Mɛ̃ otaa-taa eyɛɛn onse Mãsia, mɛ̃ k'epfuru wɛ, ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ me nkuul a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal atsweel b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Mɛ̃ ndi y'ãwua mã bibi ye fool lɛn onse ɔ̃kwal k'efa wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, myam kɛn ekeedzii kwɛn abwel mɛ̃ enkɛɛ, k'ekab nzuru ye Mãsia, me ndɔɔ a baan-ngoo a mɛ̃, be ndi mɛ̃ yam ngelemɔ̃ ye bɔ m'emfa ki ombuul. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Bɔ b'ali afi-Isalayel, b'ésuul Nziã baan a ndɛ, b'éwi ndɛ lweel e ndɛ, b'étɛn ndɛ ondoo ye bɔ, b'éwi ndɛ Ngel, b'ésuo ndɛ emfa ki abuɛɛn, b'élieel ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'ekieel esa ndɛ, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />bvool b'éwi ndɛ ankiɔɔn. Mãsia hɛ̃ m'emfa ki ombuul oli wa yam e bɔ, ndɛ wu oli ke ywel a mbueel, bvool wu oli Nziã wu alweel ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. Amɛn!<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Ke ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri Endɔɔ e Nziã efi mfel wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bueel b'éburu Isalayel k'ali ba yam li taa-taa li Isalayel wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Onkyam ŋɛn bɔ ali ba yam li Abalayam, bɔ bueel k'ali baan b'Abalayam ba taa-taa wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ Nziã álieel Abalayam ndiri: «Isak mbuul wu akieel aburu yɛ ãyam bibi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Obɛ 21.12</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri baan a Nziã, k'eli baan b'aburu m'emfa ki ombuul wɛ. Kɛn a baan b'awal onge yam, eli b'éyɛɛn Nziã ndiri àwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, tal ãyɛɛn m'élieel Nziã: «Mɛ̃ ekieel eyebvool me lio li lili li bu, obobɔ Sala akieel aburu muaan wu bɔɔl<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Obɛ 18.10</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 18:14">14</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />K'esɛn oŋɔ̃ wɛ, eli hɛ̃ ye Lebeka, wu áburu baan buaal ye bɔɔl kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, bɔɔl olɔ Isak wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Baan obɔ, ale kɛn aburu bɔ wɛ, bvool ale kɛn asi ekal obvɛ, ekal obi wɛ. Kɛn ɔ̃yɛɛl a Nziã akal m'emfa ki éwɛɛ ndɛ, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />ke m'ɛ̃sal wɛ. Ndɛ ofi ola wu ata mbel. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã álieel Lebeka ndiri: «Ɔ̃kuul àkal ɔ̃sal a mvɔɔl.» <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Eli onge b'ákel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nsueel Dzakab, k'Esahu wɛ<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ ɛ̃liaal ndiri «Mɛ̃ nzii Dzakab, mɛ̃ mbyel Esahu».</char></note>.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Obɛ 29.31</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ omã eyɛɛn? Nziã oli y'ɔ̃bɛɛ? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ álieel Moyize ndiri: «Mɛ̃ èyoo ãwua me wu nzii k'eyoo mɛ̃ ãwua, bvool mɛ̃ èyoo ãnyiĩ me wu nzii k'eyo mɛ̃ ãnyiĩ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Opa 33.19</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Obobɔ, osuaal b'esuaal Nziã k'ofa me b'edzii mbuul wuo me mpɛn yi esa ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a me Nziã wu ayoo ãnyiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, Nziã olieel Falahɔ̃ bubu: «Mɛ̃ nsueel yɛ m'otsɛn, me ndɔɔ yi esuo mpɛn a mɛ̃ me nkuul a yɛ, bvool me ndɔɔ yɛn nsia a nkuũ a mɛ̃ etsɔɔn me nsie yueel.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Opa 9.16</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã ayoo ãnyiĩ me wu edzii ndɛ, awa ɔ̃tswɛ mpɛn me wu edzii ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpuru ye nyiĩ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Obobɔ, baal àyɛɛn mɛ̃ ndiri: «K'otsɛn omã bvool b'ebewa Nziã baal ãmbyel?» Ke ngwel wɛ, wɛn ol'okoo k'akii b'edzii Nziã nã? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Yɛ wu mbuul, yɛ nã li, kwɛn yɛ ta enkyam ye Nziã? Eluɔ ki abuo ol'efuul wu obuo kyɛ ndiri: «Ki ebuo yɛ mɛ̃ bubu emã?» <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Wu abuo eluɔ m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ k'ali y'ɔ̃kwɛn b'abuo eluɔ bvi dzuun ye bvi eywɛn a dzuun m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ wuwu wɛ? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nziã odzii k'asuo mpuru a ndɛ, bvool asa kwɛn baal ayɛɛ waan e ndɛ. Kɛn a baal bɛn abvaan amwɛn mpuru a ndɛ bvool adziɔɔn, ndɛ okuru mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a bɔ y'osɛ-mwiĩ bibi. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ ádzii k'asuo opfel b'onduru okuun bo lweel e ndɛ ola baal b'esio ndɛ nyiĩ, b'éyɛɛl ndɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel me ndɔɔ a lweel olɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Baal obɔ eli bia-byɛ b'éti ndɛ mbel, ke kɛn onse Ayuda wɛ, eli hɛ̃ onse bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Nziã oyɛɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ onse ɔ̃nkaan wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn Odze ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Yam lɛn k'éli yam e mɛ̃ wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">mɛ̃ èta lɔ me yam e mɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Wɛn k'áli mbuul a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio wɛ, mɛ̃ èta ndɛ me mbuul a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:25">Odz 2.25</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Bvool onkyam ke mboo yi ákeliaal bɔ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">“Byɛ k'eli yam e mɛ̃ wɛ”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">àta bɔ me baan a Nziã wa mwiĩ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:1">Odz 2.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Me b'otal ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi, ndɛ oswɛn me ndɔɔ Isalayel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">«Onkyam ŋɛn yam li Isalayel eyii lam m'olɔɔ onge esɛɛ bvi ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">b'àbvuul baal ke kwɛ onse bɔ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22">Edz 10.22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam àsa m'eyɛɛn Endɔɔ e ndɛ tswa-tswa bvool m'emfa ki ɔ̃koo me nsie.» <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Edzayi hɛ̃ álieel ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Okɛɛn Mfam Sabahot<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkuũ a Nziã oyɔ m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ebele ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Nga-Eta»</char></note> k'ásiil bia-byɛ yam wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">kɛn a bia-byɛ ekeekal onge bviil li Sodome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">kɛn bia-byɛ ekeekal emfa ngemɔ̃ ye bviil li Gomɔɔl.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Edz 1.9</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalayel y'okal dzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Obɔbɔ, bia-byɛ omã eyɛɛn? Baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bɛn k'ákeluɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã dzu wɛ, ayii dzu m'okiool o bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />Kɛn a baal b'Isalayel b'ákedzii k'akal dzu me nkuul a Ngel, k'akoo k'akal dzu me yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />M'emã? Me ndɔɔ yɛn, bɔ k'abii k'akal dzu me nkuul a okiool wɛ, bɔ abii k'akal dzu m'ɛ̃sal. Bɔ bu abɛɛl tsa me nkɔɔn yi ebal baal, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />onge b'ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Mɛ̃ nsuul ke nkio yi Siɔ̃ nkɔɔn yi abɛɛl tsa me yɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">emɛɛ̃ li ebal baal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Wu alɔ okiool onse lɔ k'àyoo opfuru wɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Edz 28.16</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Andoo, ndɔɔ yi nzii mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ ndyam wueel bvool yi esɔɔ mɛ̃ ola Nziã, obvuul b'Ayuda. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ bam etsweel bɔ wɛn bɔ ali y'ɔ̃tio a Nziã, kɛn ɔ̃tio ondɛ k'afa m'oyɛɛ bo ngwanya wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'ayɛɛ emfa ki esuul Nziã baal dzu ke mviil ã ndɛ wɛ. Bɔ abii emfa ki bam ki akal dzu. Bɔ ŋ'abee nkuul yi esueel Nziã m'osuul o baal dzu. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Mãsia obiri Ngel k'otsɛn o yɔ, kwɛn mbuul wueel wu akiool ndɛ akal dzu ke mviil ã Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Endɔɔ, okiool, obvuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Moyize ákel bubu me ndɔɔ a mbuul wu odzii k'akal dzu m'olweel o Ngel: «Mbuul wu àsa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ àkal y'elaã me mɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18.5</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Kɛn a mbuul wu odzii k'akal dzu ke mviil ã Nziã me nkuul a okiool, abee oyɛɛn onse ɔ̃kwal ndiri: «Wu àyi ywel nã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12">Det 30.12</ref> </char></note>?» Ke ngwel wɛ, oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asa kwɛn Mãsia asool ke lɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Abee hɛ̃ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Wu àsool onse ywɛn li ela li ke nsɛn a nsie nã?» Oŋɔ̃ ŋ'asa kwɛn andɛɛl Mãsia onse b'ákwi-ákwi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">Det 30.13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Etal b'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã me ndɔɔ emfa ki akal dzu: «Endɔɔ eli tsotsoo a yɛ, onse ɔ̃nywã a yɛ bvool onse ɔ̃kwal a yɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:14">Det 30.14</ref></char></note>» Endɔɔ olɔ, li okiool li ebetee bee. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋɛn yɛ yɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã a yɛ wɛn Yeso oli Mfam, bvool ŋɛn yɛ kiool onse ɔ̃kwal a yɛ wɛn Nziã áseel ndɛ onse b'ákwi-ákwi, yɛ àbvuul. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okiool b'osuul mbuul dzu, ofa onse ɔ̃kwal. Oyɛɛn hɛ̃ b'obiri mbuul k'obvuul, opal m'ɔ̃nywã. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã olieel bubu: «Mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu olɔ okiool onse ndɛ k'àbɔɔ opfuru wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Edz 28.16</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okam k'oli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ Ayuda y'Agelek wɛ. Bɔ bueel ali ye Mfam ngɔmɔ̃, wu asa obvɛ bibi me baal bueel b'ata ndɛ mbel. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, áyɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul ɔ̃bi pyɛ wu àta Mfam mbel, àbvuul<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Dzw 3.5</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Emfa emã ki eta bɔ mbuul wɛn bɔ k'akiool wɛ mbel? Emfa emã ki èkiool bɔ mbuul wɛn bɔ k'ayoo k'etee baal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ? Emfa emã ki èyoo bɔ okɛɛn mbuul wu atee bɔ pyɛ? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Okɛɛn k'ayuɔɔl mbuul wɛ, emfa emã ki ètee ndɛ? Ákel ndiri: «Ntaã e baal b'atee Nsia yi Ngesɛ eli yam mvɛ-mvɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Edz 52.7</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 2:1">Nah 2.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Kɛn a bueel k'akiool Nsia yi Ngesɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Edzayi áfuul bubu: «Mfam, wu okiool ãtee ã bee nã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Edz 53.1</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Obobɔ, okiool oya me m'ayoo, m'ayoo ãya m'Endɔɔ e Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ efuul wɛn: Bɔ k'ayoo wɛ? Ngwanyã, bɔ ayoo. Nzal-a-ŋɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Nkii a bɔ esiaan me nsie yueel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">ãyɛɛn ã bɔ ãyɛn tiil ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri a nsie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:7">Ãnz 19.7</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Mɛ̃ bvool efuul wɛn: Baal b'Isalayel k'akwaal otsɛn o ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ? Moyize mpii tsɔɔn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel áyɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Mɛ̃ èsa kwɛn byɛ ekal y'efeel me ndɔɔ a yam lɛn k'eli yam wɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Mɛ̃ èsa kwɛn byɛ eya mpuru me ndɔɔ a yam lɛn ãyal pyɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32.21</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Edzayi bu adzi nkaã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Bɛn k'ákebii mɛ̃ wɛ abɔɔ mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">mɛ̃ nsuo nzuru ola bɛn k'ákefuul mɛ̃ ɛ̃mfuul wɛ.»<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Kɛn a me b'otal yam li Isalayel, Nziã olieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, mɛ̃ ebeyal mviɔɔl ola yam lɛn k'elweel mɛ̃ wɛ, bvool ebee k'eyoo mɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1-2">Edz 65.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nziã yam e ndɛ eboo atiɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ efuul wɛn: Nziã yam e ndɛ eboo atiɔ? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, myam ndi ɔ̃fi-Isalayel, ɔ̃tiɔɔl a Abalayam. Mɛ̃ mpal me yam li Bɛnzamɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nziã k'atiɔ yam e ndɛ eboo wɛ, yam li éyɛɛ ndɛ ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. Onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, Eli wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã oyefɛn yam li Isalayel ola Nziã. Byɛ k'eyɛɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ wɛ? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Tal b'élieel ndɛ wu Eli: «Mfam, bɔ abam aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a yɛ, bɔ atsal ãnkiin m'awa yɛ ãkab. Mɛ̃ nsiil myam ɔ̃tu, bvool bɔ adzii k'abam mɛ̃ hɛ̃! <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />K'ɔ̃mveel wu ébveel Nziã ndɛ ɔ̃mã? Mɛ̃ nkwee baal amiil nsiaan (7.000), bɛn k'abvi ãbuo ke nkwel a nziã wa Bahal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bahal oli nziã wu etiɔ wu afi-kanaan wu ábiri k'Isalayel. Me lio li ɔ̃liaa-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Eli, baal bibi al'ayii abuɛɛn ndɛ (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 18">1Ak 18</ref></char>).</note> wɛ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, me lio li, eli ye baal ke kwɛ b'abvuul, b'ésueel Nziã me nyiĩ a ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Kɛn okɛɛn Nziã osueel bɔ me nyiĩ a ndɛ, ŋɛn k'eli me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ wɛ. Al'okɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɛ̃sal, ŋɛn nyiĩ k'ebekal nyiĩ bvool wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nki? Ki ebii Isalayel, ndɛ k'abɔɔ kyɛ wɛ. Kɛn a b'ésueel Nziã, bɔ abɔɔ bvi ekebii bɔ. Me b'otal bakyɛ, Nziã osuul bɔ ayii y'ɔ̃tswɛ mpɛn. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Ngwanywã, Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ayɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«Tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã, Nziã osi kwɛn ɔ̃fel a bɔ akal me twal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">Obobɔ, bɔ ali ye mviil, kɛn a bɔ k'amwɛn eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">ali y'ãtswi, kɛn bɔ k'ayoo ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Ɔ̃kwɛn David olieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Yɔɔl kwɛn bvi-odza e bɔ ekal</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">onge bɛɛ wu ekwɔɔl bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">onge okii b'etoo bɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">onge eluɔ ki abɛɛl tsa me kyɛ, kwɛn bɔ abva, bvool abɔɔ etumbu ki ebvaan me bɔ! <verse eid="ROM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mviil ã bɔ ãbva empeel, kwɛn bɔ abee eluɔ omwɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">Suul bɔ akal ɛ̃nguo ebva ãlio mbueel!»<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ efuul wɛn, ŋ'ebɛɛl Ayuda tsa, bɔ ŋ'abvi ɔ̃bu? K'obobɔ bam wɛ! Kɛn me ndɔɔ elyal e bɔ, baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ abɔɔ obvuul, kwɛn esa bɔ b'afi-Isalayel efeel. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Okɛɛn elyal ki Ayuda ewi opfel bibi m'ɔ̃kiri, bvool okwal o bɔ owi bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ opfel bibi, kieel ol'ekal bwɛn-a-bwɛn ŋ'ekieel esam Ayuda bam onse obvuul b'ɔ̃koo?<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvuul o bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Mɛ̃ boongyɛɛn ye byɛ bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ: Onge bɛn mɛ̃ ndi ntam a baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, mɛ̃ elweel ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn mɛ̃ ol'esi baal a yam e mɛ̃ efeel, kwɛn bakyɛ onse bɔ abvuul. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ésuul Nziã bɔ me pyɛ, ndɛ ábveel ondoo y'ɔ̃kiri. Obobɔ, ŋ'ekieel eyɔɔ ndɛ bɔ bvool, k'ekal onge bɛn b'akwi-ákwi asiool wɛ? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Okɛɛn boo e pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ li amampa li ɛ̃kwel eli li ngel, pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ wu osiil wueel àkal wa ngel hɛ̃. Okɛɛn hɛ̃ ɛ̃dza mi ɔ̃ti ɛ̃li mi Nziã, ãpɔɔ̃ ã̀kal mã ndɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Yam li Isalayel eli onge ɔ̃ti wu Olive vu ákwɛn m'okwɛn, wu átsiil ãpɔɔ̃ mãkyɛ. Yɛ wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, yɛ li onge ɔ̃ti wu Olibve wu edzwa, ándɛɛl yɛ onse ãpɔɔ̃ m'ãsiil. Obobɔ, yɛ hɛ̃ yii abɔɔ bvel li ãdza m'ãfa k'ɛ̃dza mi Olibve. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee ntwel obɛɛl ke nkwel ãpɔɔ̃ m'atsiil. Kɛn okɛɛn ekoo m'osa kwɛn yɛ bɛɛl ntwel, yɛɛ wɛn wu abiri ɛ̃dza ke yɛ wɛ, kɛn a myɛ̃ mi ɛ̃biri yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Owɛɛl yɛ koo k'ayɛɛn wɛn: Nziã ámbaal ãpɔɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi andɛɛl mɛ̃ ndyam. <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ngwnywã! Nziã ámbaal mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yɛn mɔ̃ ãywɛn okiool. Kɛn a yɛ, yɛ Nziã andɛɛl yɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ li y'okiool. Obobɔ, bee nzuru ondɛɛl, bal Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, onge bɛn Nziã k'ákwɛɛn k'atsiil ãpɔɔ̃ m'ɔ̃ti wu ákwɛn m'okwɛn wɛ, oŋɔ̃ wu ekwɛɛn ndɛ otsiil yɛ wu ándɛɛl m'ondɛɛl? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Tal, Nziã oli ngesɛ, bvool k'abveel kuul mbee wɛ: Ndɛ awa b'abvi etumbu, k'abveel kuul mbee wɛ. Ndɛ oli ngesɛ ke ola yɛ, okɛɛn yɛ kal onse obvɛ o ndɛ. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, àtsiil yɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃ me bɔ, okɛɛn bɔ apal onse oywɛn b'okiool, Nziã àndɛɛl bɔ m'ɔ̃ti. Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ndɛ oli ye waan li andɛɛl bɔ bvool. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ngwanyã, yɛ áli pɔɔ̃ li ɔ̃ti wu Olibve wu edzwa. Átsiil yɛ, bvool ándɛɛl yɛ m'ɔ̃ti wu Olibve wu ákwɛn m'okwɛn. Kwɛn ŋɛn ɔ̃ti ondɛ k'ali etsɛn e yɛ wɛ. Me b'otal Ayuda, bɔ ali ãpɔɔ̃ m'ãmɛn me mam m'ɔ̃ti wu ákwɛn m'okwɛn. Obobɔ, Nziã àndɛɛl bɔ bam fool pyɛ nkal ɔ̃ti a bam, wu émɛn bɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvuul o yam li Isalayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ebee ndɔɔ yi m'edziɔɔn yi odzɛɛn, kwɛn byɛ ebee byam owal onge anga-ãyal: Baal b'Isalayel bakyɛ àkal y'ɔ̃tswɛ-mpɛn tiil ye k'ebɔɔ ãyam mbueel mã baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ ãbvuul. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />M'emfa okyɛ, yam li Isalayel lueel ekieel ebvuul, onge b'ákel ndiri: «Ɔ̃mvuul àfa Siɔ̃. Ndɛ àmbaal elyal ki ãyam ã Dzakab.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Okyɛ emfa ki èkal ondoo o mɛ̃ ye bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">me lio li ekieel embaal mɛ̃ ãbi ã bɔ.»<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Me b'otal Nsia yi Ngesɛ, bɔ ali ataal a Nziã, me ndɔɔ obvɛ o byɛ. Kɛn a me b'otal emfa ki esuaal Nziã, Nziã odzii bɔ me ndɔɔ ankiɔɔn a bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã k'awɛɛl ãkab m'ewi ndɛ onse nyiĩ a ndɛ wɛ, bvool k'aswɛɛl ãtsam ã ndɛ wɛ me ndɔɔ a b'eti ndɛ mbel. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Byɛ, byɛ tsɔɔn al'ébee k'élweel Nziã, kɛn a meba Nziã osio byɛ nyiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn Ayuda k'álweel ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Eli emfa kiki hɛ̃ me bɔ: Meba, bɔ abee k'alweel Nzia, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ osio byɛ nyiĩ. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã osio bɔ nyiĩ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã owɔɔl baal bueel onse oywɛn o lweel, kwɛn ndɛ asuo obvɛ o ndɛ ola baal bueel.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziĩ yi olweel o Nziã</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Ee, opfel o Nziã oli ngamfɛn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Ãyal y'oyɛɛ b'eyɛɛ Nziã oli ye dzio!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Wu okoo k'ayɛɛ m'ekuru Nziã nã?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Wu okoo k'akwaal otsɛn o m'ewɛɛ Nziã nã? <verse eid="ROM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã oyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Ke yam, wu oyɛɛ ãtsam ã Mfam nã?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Ɔ̃mpa-luo a ndɛ nã?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Wu awi ndɛ ɛ̃kwel nã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">kwɛn ndɛ abveel ndɛ ɔ̃nkaal?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Edz 40.13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 41:3">Dzb 41.3</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bvieel eli bvi ndɛ, asi bvɛ me nkuul a ndɛ, bvool me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn alweel ndɛ ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Omwiĩ b'alili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Obobɔ andoo, onge bɛn Nziã osuo bia-byɛ obvɛ o ndɛ, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ luo wɛn, ekab ndɛ nzuru a byɛ onge kab li mwiĩ, li ngel, bvool li ekiool ndɛ. Omɔ̃ ãbuɛɛn mã m'emfa ki Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Ebee odzuu m'emfa ki ɔ̃kiri wa nonɔ̃ wu. Eyɔɔl kwɛn Nziã aswɛɛl byɛ emfa bvool awa byɛ ãyal m'ãnyiɔɔn, kwɛn byɛ ebwɛɛl b'edzii Nziã, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ, ndɔɔ yi esa ndɛ esɛ, ye ndɔɔ yi ɔ̃koo.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Me nyiĩ yi esio Nziã mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ abee otsam ndiri ndɛ oli mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn, m'emfa ki enduru kyɛn ebvaan ndɛ akal. Kɛn a mbuul bwɛn a mbuul atsam ngesɛ, m'emfa ki ɔ̃mvɛɛl wu okiool b'ewi Nziã ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ eli nzuru ngamɔ̃. Yɔ eli y'elyam bibi, kɛn elyam obvɛ k'esa ɔ̃sal wuwu wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, bia-byɛ b'eli bibi, eli nzuru ngamɔ̃ onse Mãsia, bvool bia-byɛ bueel ebvɔɔn ye bakyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Kɛn a Nziã owi bia-byɛ ãkab, mɛn k'ãli emfa ngemɔ̃ wɛ. Mɔ̃ ãli m'emfa e nyiĩ yi ésio Nziã bia-byɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul wu oli ye kab li ayɛɛn ãndɔɔ m'ãfa ola Nziã, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ ayɛɛn m'emvɛɛl li okiool. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Wa ye kab li awuaal bakyɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ akuru nzuru m'ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. Wu ayiool, ayiool ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Wu awɛɛl bakyɛ, awɛɛl ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, wu awa eluɔ, awa ɔ̃kwal kal. Wu abiri baal, abiri ye nzal a obiri yueel, wu asio nyiĩ asio yɔ y'esɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Yɔɔl kwɛn dzii ekal li eywɛn a pfuru. Ebyal obi, ekuru nzuru m'obvɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Me b'otal dzii e bakyɛ, edzii bakyɛ me dzii li baan a Nziã. Ekal baal b'ɛ̃kwel b'awal bakyɛ ye dzuun. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ebee y'obwal okal, ekal ye nzal a ɔ̃sal. Esa ɔ̃sal a Mfam ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Esia mpaa me kaã li eli a byɛ. Ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ onse ãmpal. Ekuru nzuru m'ãbuɛɛn ãlio mbueel. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ewuaal a baal ba ngel b'ali ye kɔɔ. Eyɔɔ anzii ngesɛ owɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Endɔɔl b'atuaal byɛ mpal kuɔɔl. Endɔɔl kuɔɔl, ebee baal enkɛɛ obwel. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Esia mpaa ye b'asia mpaa, elel ye b'alel. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Ekal bam y'ɔ̃dzi. Ebee y'ondɛɛl o nzuru okal, ebii ãndɔɔ mã nkuaal-a-nkuaal. Ebee otsam wɛn byɛ b'enduru ãyal.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Ebee obi m'obi obveel. Esa mpɛn yi esa obvɛ ke nkwel a baal bueel. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Okɛɛn byɛ ekoo, bvool ŋɛn ndɔɔ yɛn wu obvaan m'osa o yɔ byɛ, ekal y'opi ye baal bueel. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Andoo, ebee obi obveel byam, eyɔɔ mpuru a Nziã esal, ke ngwel wɛ Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã oyɛɛn bubu: «Mfam olieel ndiri: “Wu abveel obi mɛ̃, mɛ̃ wu awa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ndɔɔ yi ebvaan me ndɛ!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32.35</ref></char></note>”» <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Ndɛ bvool olieel ndiri: «Kɛn okɛɛn ɔ̃taal a yɛ oli ye nzal, wa ndɛ bvi-odza, okɛɛn ndɛ oyoo nzuaal, wa ndɛ ãdza. Ke Ngwel wɛ, yɛ asa obobɔ, eli onge bɛn yɛ bvool ndɛ ãkal ã mbaa nkal ɔ̃tswɛ.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Det 32.35</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Ãmb 25.21-22</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Bee obi nkuul yi ebvel bɔ yɛ owa, bvel obi m'obvɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki akal ke nkwel amfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akal ye lweel li amfam b'asuul ke nkwel, ke ngwel wɛ k'eli y'omfam bɛn k'ofi ola Nziã wɛ wɛ, bvool b'ali m'omfam, wu áwi bɔ ompu Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, wu obee k'alweel mfam, ŋ'abee k'alweel ɔ̃yɛɛl a Nziã. B'abee olweel abii etumbu e bam. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ngwanywã, ŋ'esa mbuul obvɛ, ndɛ k'ali ye buɔ b'amfam wɛ, kɛn a ŋ'esa ndɛ obi, ebvaan ndɛ akal ye buɔ o bɔ. Yɛ dzii k'abee ye buɔ o mfam okal, oŋɔ̃ sa obvɛ, m'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ àtuɛɛn yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mfam abesa ɔ̃sal a Nziã me ndɔɔ obvɛ o yɛ. Kɛn a yɛ asa obi, kal ye buɔ, nzal-a-ŋɛn epwel ki esiin ndɛ ke ki ngwel wɛ. Ŋ'ebewa ndɛ baal etumbu, ndɛ ŋ'abesa ɔ̃sal a Nziã, m'osuo o mpuru a ndɛ wu Nziã ola mbuul wu asa obi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ebvaan akal ye lweel: K'eli kɛn a me ndɔɔ yi akal ye buɔ o mpuru a Nziã wɛ, eli hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yɛn ɔ̃kwal a bia-byɛ asɔɔ obobɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Obɔ hɛ̃ otsɛn b'ebefuru byɛ mpal. Ke ngwel wɛ, b'abeyɔɔ mpal oyɔ abesal me ndɔɔ a Nziã m'ɔ̃sal ondɛ. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ewa mbuul bwɛn a mbuul eluɔ kyɛn ebvaan awa ndɛ. Okɛɛn mpal, efuru yɔ ola wɛn ebvaan afuru yɔ, okɛɛn nzi yi atsiil, efuru yɔ ola wɛn ebvaan afuru yɔ, okɛɛn lweel, elweel wu obvaan me lɔ, okɛɛn bvɛɛ, ewa bvɛɛ me wu obvaan me lɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzii e bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Ebee y'ebiin e mbuul okal. Ebiin e byɛ ekal kɛn a ki edzii byɛ bakyɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, wu adzii wumɔ̃ ŋ'asi m'esɔɔ Ngel. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel osa mã: «Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ, oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ, oyɛɛ ke turu eluɔ e mbuul wɛ, oyɛɛ ke lɔ eluɔ e mbuul ɔ̃kwal wɛ.» Ãndɔɔ m'etam Ngel osa omɔ̃ mbueel ye m'ãsiil, ãsoo nzuru onse ngel ngamɔ̃ yi eyɛɛn bubu: «Yɛ adzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam.» <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Mbuul wu oli ye dzii k'asa ngaburu-mbuul obi wɛ. Ŋ'adzii bakyɛ, ŋ'asa m'etam Ngel osa.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okal y'ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ oya o Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ewal ndɔɔ oyɔ y'ɔ̃bvɛn, ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eyɛɛ lio li eyii bia-byɛ: Lio ŋ'emeekoo li esiool byɛ me twal, ke ngwel wɛ, meba, obvuul oyii bam tsotsoo a bia-byɛ, onduru emfa ki éli bɔ me lio li ékiool bia-byɛ Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Tsia ŋ'asa abwel bvool bviil ŋ'oyii otsa. Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebee ãndɔɔ m'empeel bvool elaal ãta mã mwiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Bia-byɛ ekal y'epfuũ bvi ngesɛ, bvi ebvaan m'okal a bvɛ me mwiĩ. Bia-byɛ ebee odza y'onywã b'onduru ɔ̃ndel, ebee y'anga-akal wuo y'anga-alam odzuu, eyɔɔl omwiĩ b'epwa, ebee obebel bvool ebee y'ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ okal. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Kɛn ekal emfa ngemɔ̃ onge Mfam Yeso Mãsia. Ebee nguo okɛɛ me ndɔɔ a nzuru a byɛ m'osa b'ãndɔɔ m'etam yɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Obam o bakyɛ me mbyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Eyɔɔ mbuul wɛn kɛn awam onse okiool wɛ, ebee ndɛ ofiɛɛn m'ɛ̃dzoo ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ okiool bam ndiri ndɛ okoo k'adza bvieel, wukyɛ wɛn kɛn awam wɛ adza kɛn ãsɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wu adza abee wɛn k'adza wɛ ofiɛɛn, wɛn k'adza wɛ abee hɛ̃ wu adza me mbyel obam, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã amaayɔɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Yɛ ndyam nã li, kwɛn yɛ tsiil ndɔɔ a anga-ɔ̃sal? Ekal ndɛ okal tɛ, ekal ndɛ obvi, etal mfam a ndɛ. Ndɛ akal tɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Mfam oli ye waan li awuaal a ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ atsam ndiri eli y'ãtsoo m'ãnduru mãkyɛ, wukyɛ ndiri ãtsoo mbueel ãli emfa ngemɔ̃. Ebvaan kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul akiool bam onse ɔ̃kwal ndiri ãtsam ã ndɛ ãli me nkuul. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Mbuul wu amwɛn kwɛn eli y'ãtsoo m'ãkam ye mãkyɛ, asa obobɔ me ndɔɔ a lweel e Mfam. Wu adza, me ndɔɔ a lweel e Mfam abedza, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn. Wɛn k'adza wɛ, k'adza wɛ me ndɔɔ a lweel e Mfam. Ndɛ hɛ̃ abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ngwanyã, mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ onse bia-byɛ k'akal m'omwiĩ me ndɔɔ a ndyam wɛ, mbuul si ɔ̃mɔ̃ k'akwa hɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndyam wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn bia-byɛ eli mwiĩ, eli mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a Mfam, okɛɛn ekwa, me ndɔɔ a Mfam ekwa. Obobɔ, ekal ŋ'eli bia-byɛ mwiĩ, ekal ŋ'ekwi bia-byɛ, bia-byɛ eli ba Mfam. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn Mãsia okwi, bvool osiool, me ndɔɔ yi akal Mfam a b'ákwi-ákwi ye b'amwii-mwiĩ. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Obobɔ, otsɛn omã bɛn yɛ ndyam abebam ndoo me mbyel? Wuo ki ebefiɛɛn yɛ ndoo emã? Nzal-a-ŋɛn, bia-byɛ bueel ekieel etsuun ke mbal a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Mfam olieel ndiri: Onge bɛn mɛ̃ ndi mwiĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">baal bueel abva ãbuo ke nkwel a mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">bvool bueel awa mɛ̃ lweel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Edz 45.23</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ onse bia-byɛ akieel ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ emfa ki edzuu ndyam ke nkwel a Nziã.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obal o nga-ndoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebee bakyɛ me mbyel obam. Ekal y'ãyal kwɛn byɛ ebee ndɔɔ osa yi ebɛɛl nga-ndoo tsa me yɔ wuo yi ebal ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ ngesɛ bvool nkiool bam ngwanywa me bvoo a mɛ̃ ye Mfam Yeso wɛn, eluɔ k'eli ye mbiin me kyam wɛ. Kɛn okɛɛn mbuul atsam ndiri, eluɔ eli ye mbiin, ŋɛn kyɛ eli ye mbiin me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Okɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza, yɛ biil ɔ̃kwal a nga-ndoo a yɛ, ŋɛn yɛ ke bedzuu m'emfa ki dzii wɛ. Me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza, bee osa kwɛn ndoo a yɛ, wu ékwi Mãsia me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, adziɔɔn. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn eluɔ ki eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ, mbuul abee byɛ okwee me ndɔɔ a kyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Okwɛn o Nziã k'otal odza y'onywã wɛ, bɔ otal ãndɔɔ mã dzu, opi y'esɛ, bvi eya m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu asa ɔ̃sal a Mãsia m'emfa okyɛ, awa Nziã esɛ, bvool baal akiool ndɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Obobɔ, bia-byɛ ebii kɛn obii m'ãbiri opi, ye m'ãsa kwɛn bia-byɛ eyi nkwel onse okiool mboo mɔ̃. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Me ndɔɔ a bvi-odza, bee ɔ̃sal a Nziã otsal. Ke yam, bvieel eli tsɛtsɛ. Kɛn a k'eli ngesɛ wɛ kwɛn bvi-odza e mbuul ebal wukyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Okɛɛn tuo li edza yɛ, wuo mbal ã bvine m'enywã yɛ, wuo ndɔɔ ke mã yi esa yɛ yi ebal ndoo a yɛ, ngesɛ bee yɔ osa. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Okiool b'eli a yɛ, kwɛɛ bɔ me ndɔɔ a yam ke nkwel a Nziã. Esɛ me mbuul wɛn k'amwɛn kwɛn ndɛ abesa obi-obi wɛ, ŋ'ewɛɛ ndɛ k'asa ndɔɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Kɛn a mbuul wu eli y'enkyam ŋ'edza ndɛ, ŋ'abam nzuru a ndyam me mbyel, me ndɔɔ yɛn yi esa ndɛ k'eli ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ y'okiool wɛ. Kwɛn ŋɛn, ndɔɔ yueel yɛn k'eli ɔ̃nguo ngɔmɔ̃ y'okiool eli obi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Wa ngaburu-mbuul esɛ, ke yam wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Bia-byɛ b'emeewam onse okiool, ebvaan bia-byɛ ekuru ɔ̃kwal ke nkwel okwal o bɛn kɛn awam onse okiool wɛ. Ebee b'edzii bia-byam osa. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul asa b'edzii ngaburu-mbuul, me ndɔɔ obvɛ o ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ akwel onse okiool. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Mãsia k'ábii b'edzii ndyam wɛ. Kɛn ákel ndiri: «Ɛ̃tswɛ mi etoo baal yɛ ɛ̃bvi nkal a mɛ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Ãnz 69.10</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Ɛ̃nkaan mvieel mi ngel mi ákel tsɔɔn, ákel myɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi awa bia-byɛ ãyal, kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal ye kaã, m'osɛ-mwiĩ y'owɛɛl b'ewa ãndɔɔ ã Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu awa osɛ-mwiĩ bvool awɛɛl baal asa kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ɔ̃dzi, m'emfa ki Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />M'emfa okyɛ, onse ɔ̃dzi bvool ɔ̃nywã ngɔmɔ̃, byɛ elweel Nziã wu Tal a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mãsia wu Ɔ̃sal a baal bueel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Obobɔ, eyɔɔ bakyɛ onge b'eyɔɔ Mãsia ndyam byɛ, me ndɔɔ a lweel e Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, Mãsia oyii ɔ̃sal a Ayuda, me ndɔɔ yi asuo otaa-taa o Nziã, ŋ'esi ndɛ m'éyɛɛn Nziã ol'ankiɔɔn a bɔ ndiri ndɛ asa. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Me b'otal baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, bɔ alweel Nziã me ndɔɔ obvɛ o ndɛ, onge b'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ èlweel yɛ onse baal b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ ɛ̃kyam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">mɛ̃ èyam me ndɔɔ a lweel e nkuũ a yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:50">Ãnz 18.50</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã bvool oyɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Byɛ bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, esia mpaa ye yam e ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Det 32.43</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ndɛ bvool olieel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«Byɛ bueel bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, elweel Mfam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">byɛ b'ãyam mbueel, eyam me ndɔ a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Ãnz 117.1</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="ROM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Edzayi hɛ̃ olieel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Mbuul wa yam e Dzese akieel aya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Ndɛ akieel atɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi akal y'okwɛn nkal ãyam ãkyam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">ãyam omɔ̃ ãkieel ata kaã me ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Edz 11.1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu awa kaã aluul byɛ m'opi y'esɛ onse okiool o byɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ eluul me kaã me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal!<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal a Pool ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Andoo, me b'otal byɛ, myam nkiool bam wɛn, byɛ eluul m'ãtsam mã ngesɛ, eluul m'oyɛɛ bueel, bvool ekoo k'ewa bakyɛ ãluo. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Kɛn ãlio mãkyɛ, mɛ̃ ke mveel kuul mbee wɛ ŋe nkel mɛ̃ byɛ m'oyeel o byɛ m'eyio byɛ. Mɛ̃ nsi obobɔ, me ndɔɔ a nyiĩ yi esio Nziã mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />Nyiĩ oyɔ esi kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal ɔ̃sal a Yeso Mãsia me ndɔɔ obvɛ o baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. Mɛ̃ ŋ'ebesa ɔ̃sal wa ngel wu etee Nsia yi Ngesɛ, kwɛn bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ akal onge kab li ekiool Nziã, li esuul Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal eyii li ngel. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Obɔ otsɛn be ndi mɛ̃ y'esɛ onse Yeso Mãsia, m'ɔ̃sal wu ebesa mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ nkoo k'eyɛɛn ndɔɔ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn kɛn a b'esi Mãsia me nkuul a mɛ̃, kwɛn bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ alweel Nziã. Ndɛ osi obobɔ m'ãyɛɛn y'ɛ̃sal, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />m'emvieel y'emwã e waan, bvi me nkuul a waan li Ɔ̃fel a Nziã. Obobɔ, fa Yelusalem tiil nsie yi Ilili, mɛ̃ ntee Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mãsia ãmboo mbueel. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Mɛ̃ edzii bam k'etee Nsia yi Ngesɛ ke mboo yɛn kɛn atee Mãsia wɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee otuu nkal ãnkɔɔn ã wukyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ nsi m'emfa ki eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«Bɛn k'átee ndɛ ola bɔ wɛ akieel amwɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">bɛn k'áyoo baal ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, akieel akwaal otsɛn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Edz 52.15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛ̃yɛɛl ɛ̃ Pool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi esi kwɛn ãlio bibi akii mɛ̃ k'eyi ola byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Kɛn a meba, mɛ̃ emeeman ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ onse etswi e nsie obvɛ. Fa mvel bibi, mɛ̃ bam nzii k'eya byɛ otal. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ŋ'ekieel eyi mɛ̃ Esipanye, mɛ̃ ekieel ebwel me li byɛ, mɛ̃ etsam wɛn mɛ̃ olɔ kieel mbɔɔ ola byɛ bvi ndi mɛ̃ ye kɔɔ e bvɛ me ndɔɔ a dzwɛ. Oŋɔ̃ ke mbee esɛ ki nkal mɛ̃ ye byɛ ãtsoo ke kwɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kɛn a meba, mɛ̃ ŋ'eyi Yelusalem, m'owuaal o baal ba ngel b'ali okɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ke ngwel wɛ, akiool ba nsie yi Maseduaan ye yi Akayi adzii k'asa ɔ̃ta m'owuaal b'akiool b'aywal b'ali ke Yelusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ngwanyã, bɔ adzii k'awuaal a bɔ. Ndɔɔ oyɔ al'eyii onge ebiin. Ke ngwel wɛ, akiool b'Ayuda ákab opfel o bɔ b'ɔ̃fel ye bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ, obobɔ ebvaan kwɛn hɛ̃ bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ awa Ayuda opfel o bɔ b'eluɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ŋ'ekieel eman mɛ̃ ndɔɔ oyɔ osa, bvool ewa bɔ ɔ̃ta ondɛ ke nkwel a baal bueel, mɛ̃ ekieel eyi Esipanye me li byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn ŋ'èya mɛ̃ byɛ otal, mɛ̃ èya y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl b'ɔ̃koo b'ofa ola Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Andoo a dzii, me nkuũ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, ye dzii li ewa Ɔ̃fel, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ luo wɛn edzwaan mvel ye mɛ̃ ŋ'ebuɛɛn byɛ Nziã me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />M'emfa okyɛ, mɛ̃ èbvuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal a Yude bɛn k'akiool Mãsia wɛ, bvool baal ba ngel ba Yelusalem àyɔɔ ɔ̃ta wu ebiri mɛ̃ ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn Nziã odzii, mɛ̃ èya byɛ otal y'esɛ, bvool mɛ̃ èwuun ye byɛ etsi-tsiri. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã Nga-opi akal ye byɛ bueel! Amɛn!<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Obio bo mbuul bwɛn a mbuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl byɛ nkyel a bia-byɛ Fobe, wu asal me ndɔɔ Ebvɔɔn li bviil li Sankele, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />kwɛn byɛ eyɔɔ ndɛ me nkuũ a Mfam, m'emfa ki ebvaan ayɔɔ baal ba ngel. Ewuaal a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yueel yɛn ndɛ ol'okal ye kɔɔ e yɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áwueel a baal bibi, ye myam hɛ̃.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ebio Pilisika y'Akilas, bɔ b'andoo a mɛ̃ b'ɔ̃sal onse Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Bɔ akiool k'awa nkii a bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi abvuul mɛ̃. B'atuɛɛn bɔ k'eli kɛn a mɛ̃ wɛ, eli hɛ̃ akiool b'ãbvɔɔn mbueel mã baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ebio ebvɔɔn li onse nzɔ a bɔ hɛ̃. Ebio Epayinete wu ndoo a mɛ̃ wa dzii, wu oli mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel wu okiool Mãsia onse nsie yi Adzi. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ebio Mali wu amwɛn mpal bibi me ndɔɔ a byɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ebio Andelonikos ye Dzunias<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal bakyɛ abetsam ndiri Dzunias oli ɔ̃kal a Andelonikos.</char></note>, b'eburu e mɛ̃, b'asal bwal hɛ̃ ye mɛ̃. Antam awal bɔ ye dzuun bibi. Bɔ bam ákiool Mãsia nkwel a mɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Ebio Ampiliatus, ndoo a mɛ̃ wa dzii onse Mfam. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ebio Uubɛ̃, ndoo a bia-byɛ wu ɔ̃sal onse Mãsia, ye Sitakis wu ndoo a mɛ̃ wa dzii. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ebio Apeles wu osuo kwɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃kiool wa taa-taa me bvoo bo ye Mãsia. Ebio baal a nzɔ a Alisitobule. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ebio Helodion, wu eburu e mɛ̃. Ebio baal a nzɔ a Naasise b'akiool Mfam. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ebio Tilifɛn ye Tilifose, bɔ b'akaal b'asal bibi me ndɔɔ a Mfam. Ebio Pɛɛside, wu nkyel a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, wu asal bibi me ndɔɔ a Mfam. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ebio Lufus, wu ésueel Mfam, ye ngoo a ndɛ, wu oli ngoo a mɛ̃ hɛ̃. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ebio Asinkilite, Felegon, ye Hɛɛmes, ye Patelobas, y'Hɛɛmas, y'andoo b'ali ye bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ebio Filologe ye Dzuli, Nelee ye nkyel a ndɛ wu ɔ̃kaal, Olimpas, ye baal ba ngel bueel b'ali ye bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ebio bakyɛ ye dzii m'emfa ki ebvaan me baan a Nziã. Ãbvɔɔn ã Mãsia mbueel ãbio byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnkunkwa mã ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Andoo a mɛ̃ ba dzii, mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ luo wɛn ekal y'onkyab ke nkwel a b'abelɔ okab onse baal, bvool abebal bɔ. M'esa bɔ omɔ̃ ãkam y'ãtee m'éyɔɔ byɛ. Ekal lala ye bɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal ba m'emfa okyɛ, k'abesal me ndɔɔ a Mãsia wu Mfam a bia-byɛ wɛ, bɔ abesal me ndɔɔ ɔ̃la a bam. M'ãyɛɛn m'opɛɛn ye mã nzyal-nzyal, bɔ abepfuru anki-nkyam.<verse eid="ROM 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Me b'otal byɛ, baal bueel ayɛɛ lweel li ebelweel byɛ Mfam. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn byɛ ekal y'ãyal me b'otal ongesɛ, ekal ankinkyam me b'otal obi.<verse eid="ROM 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nziã nga-opi ŋ'asa anyam Ɔ̃pfu ke nsɛn a ntaã ɛ̃ byɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 16:20">Yɔɔl kwɛn nyiĩ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso ekal ye byɛ!<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timote wu asal ye mɛ̃ obio byɛ. Lusihus, ye Dzeson, ye Sosipatɛɛl, b'eburu e mɛ̃ hɛ̃ abio byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Mɛ̃ wu Tɛɛtius, wu nswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu atam mɛ̃ oswɛn wu, mɛ̃ mbio byɛ onse Mfam.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayios wu oyɔɔ mɛ̃, bvool wɛn ebvɔɔn lueel ebebvɔɔn onse nzɔ a ndɛ, obio byɛ hɛ̃. Elasite wu akwɛɛ nzi e bviil, ye ndoo Kaatus, abio byɛ.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />[Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ bueel nyiĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'akel yɔ w onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lweel ola Nziã wu Nga-ãyal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã! Ndɛ oli ye waan li awa byɛ mpɛn onse okiool, m'emfa ki Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi etee mɛ̃ bvool yi etsal mɛ̃, yi etal Yeso Mãsia. Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ, eli m'emfa ki ɔ̃yɛɛl a Nziã wɛn fa kal-kal ndɛ ásuul ndɛ m'edziɔɔn, wu eyɛɛl ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Kɛn a meba ndɔɔ oyɔ emɔɔn kal-a-kal m'ɛ̃nkaan mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. M'emfa ki ontam o Nziã wu ɔ̃bu, awi baal bueel bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ nkuul yi ayɛɛ ɔ̃yɛɛl ondɛ, kwɛn bɔ akiool Nziã bvool alweel ndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Elweel Nziã, ndyam sii wu Nga-ãyal! Yɔɔl kwɛn nkuũ a ndɛ ekal ye nsia, me nkuul a Yeso Mãsia, ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu! Amɛn!<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>